sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant R as React page + Axios
    participant F as FastAPI route + dependencies
    participant S as Service (@transactional)
    participant P as Repositories + SQLAlchemy
    participant O as Observers (audit, notifications)
    U->>R: Click Submit incident
    R->>F: POST /api/incidents with Bearer token (through the Vite proxy)
    F->>F: get_db, get_container, get_current_user, require_roles
    F->>S: create_incident(user, validated data)
    S->>P: Read service, SLA policy, technicians (SQLite)
    S->>O: publish(DomainEvent)
    O->>P: Audit and notification rows (same transaction)
    S->>P: commit, or rollback on any exception
    S-->>F: Incident plus duplicate warnings
    F-->>R: 201 JSON, or JSON error {detail, code} from the handlers
    R-->>U: Success dialog, or alert or toast built by errMsg
